# Raiden Fischl Sara Baizhu. ~20s Rot. Simple Shredless Aggravate with Baizhu. Sara buffs Fischl and Raiden. Baizhu fills time until his burst is ready.

# Team
raiden char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9; 
raiden add weapon="deathmatch" refine=1 lvl=90/90;
raiden add set="emblem" count=4;
